  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Оружие нежити</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">от <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Lihodey</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://github.com/LihodeyMC/UndeadWeaponsMC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">GitHub</span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Мод добавляет 5 новых моделей оружия</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Поддерживает <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Better Combat</span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Требования к эмиссивному материалу:<br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Fabric</span> — (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shader</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bclib\" rel=\"nofollow\">BCLib</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a>)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Forge</span> — (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fhome\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_ef275083-63a5-4ab5-900b-41fcee6293ae.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_b30046ef-d2df-4a33-bfa2-63ef7e171983.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_1504b670-6fca-4a54-b3a9-91f6c5678b1b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_57074f47-5170-4333-aaa8-7902bd734a28.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_69627f73-3755-45eb-aa66-b3ec809c898e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Крафтинг</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_86d2cb10-120a-4973-9863-7ddb5af23c10.png\" alt=\"Крафтинг\" width=\"202\" height=\"482\"></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Все скриншоты сделаны с помощью <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bliss-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">Bliss-шейдера</span></a></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017421/description_6c4eae4d-6fda-4fe2-8261-f3d9c0047d45.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"850\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Пожалуйста, оставьте отзыв, если обнаружите какие-либо ошибки</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><